me":"Jaddua","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"johanan-h3110l","name":"Johanan","kind":"person","brief":"Hight Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H3442","lemma":"יֵשׁוּעַ","tr":"ye·shu·a","gloss":"Jeshua","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":29},{"base":"H3113","lemma":"יוֹיָקִים","tr":"yo·ya·qim","gloss":"Joiakim","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":4},{"base":"H3205","lemma":"יָלַד","tr":"ya·lad","gloss":"to beget","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":496},{"base":"H3111","lemma":"יוֹיָדָע","tr":"yo·ya·da","gloss":"Joiada","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":5},{"base":"H3048","lemma":"יְדַעְיָה","tr":"ye·da·yah","gloss":"Jedaiah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":11},{"base":"H0475","lemma":"אֶלְיָשִׁיב","tr":"el·ya·shiv","gloss":"Eliashib","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":17},{"base":"H3129","lemma":"יוֹנָתָן","tr":"yo·na·tan","gloss":"Jonathan","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":42},{"base":"H0251","lemma":"אָח","tr":"ach","gloss":"brother: male-sibling","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":629},{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":291},{"base":"H5987","lemma":"עָמוֹק","tr":"a·moq","gloss":"Amok","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1CH","chapter":3,"verse":17,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The descendants of Jeconiah the captive: Shealtiel his son, Malchiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama, and Nedabiah. The sons of Pedaiah: Zerubbabel and Shimei. The children of Zerubbabel: Meshullam and Hananiah, their sister Shelomith,","from":1},{"book":"1CH","chapter":6,"verse":3,"verseEnd":15,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The children of Amram: Aaron, Moses, and Miriam. The sons of Aaron: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar. Eleazar was the father of Phinehas, Phinehas was the father of Abishua, Abishua was the father of Bukki, Bukki was the father of Uzzi, Uzzi was the father of Zerahiah, Zerahiah was the father of Meraioth, Meraioth was the father of Amariah, Amariah was the father of Ahitub,","from":10},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From the priests: Jedaiah, Jehoiarib, and Jachin;","from":6},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":33,"verseEnd":33,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Those who were musicians, the heads of Levite families, stayed in the temple chambers and were exempt from other duties because they were on duty day and night.","from":8},{"book":"1CH","chapter":24,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the twenty-third to Delaiah, and the twenty-fourth to Maaziah.","from":7},{"book":"EZR","chapter":2,"verse":1,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now these are the people of the province who came up from the captivity of the exiles carried away to Babylon by Nebuchadnezzar its king. They returned to Jerusalem and Judah, each to his own town, accompanied by Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Seraiah, Reelaiah, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum, and Baanah. This is the count of the men of Israel:","from":1},{"book":"EZR","chapter":2,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"accompanied by Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Seraiah, Reelaiah, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum, and Baanah. This is the count of the men of Israel:","from":1},{"book":"EZR","chapter":3,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Jeshua son of Jozadak and his fellow priests, along with Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and his associates, began to build the altar of the God of Israel to sacrifice burnt offerings on it, as it is written in the Law of Moses the man of God.","from":7}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"persian-era","title":"Persian era: Esther and the return","people":3},{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":2}]},"12-26":{"people":[{"id":"joiakim-h3113","name":"Joiakim","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":2,"firstVerse":12},{"