5},{"id":"obadiah-h5662k","name":"Obadiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"talmon-h2929","name":"Talmon","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"ezra-h5830g","name":"Ezra","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"jehozadak-h3087","name":"Jehozadak","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"joshua-h3091j","name":"Joshua","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"nehemiah-h5166h","name":"Nehemiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":26}],"places":[{"id":"persia-h6539","name":"Persia","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":22}],"words":[{"base":"H4929","lemma":"מִשְׁמָר","tr":"mish·mar","gloss":"custody","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":22},{"base":"H4918","lemma":"מְשֻׁלָּם","tr":"me·shul·lam","gloss":"Meshullam","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":25},{"base":"H3113","lemma":"יוֹיָקִים","tr":"yo·ya·qim","gloss":"Joiakim","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":4},{"base":"H7218","lemma":"רֹאשׁ","tr":"rosh","gloss":"head","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":599},{"base":"H3048","lemma":"יְדַעְיָה","tr":"ye·da·yah","gloss":"Jedaiah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":11},{"base":"H2811","lemma":"חֲשַׁבְיָ֫הוּ","tr":"cha·shav·yah","gloss":"Hashabiah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":15},{"base":"H0475","lemma":"אֶלְיָשִׁיב","tr":"el·ya·shiv","gloss":"Eliashib","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":17},{"base":"H3110","lemma":"יוֹחָנָן","tr":"yo·cha·nan","gloss":"Johanan","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":22},{"base":"H5830","lemma":"עֶזְרָא","tr":"ez·ra","gloss":"Ezra","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":22},{"base":"H3442","lemma":"יֵשׁוּעַ","tr":"ye·shu·a","gloss":"Jeshua","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":29}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"DEU","chapter":33,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"This is the blessing that Moses the man of God pronounced upon the Israelites before his death.","from":24},{"book":"JOS","chapter":14,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then the sons of Judah approached Joshua at Gilgal, and Caleb son of Jephunneh the Kenizzite said to him, “You know what the LORD said to Moses the man of God at Kadesh-barnea about you and me.","from":24},{"book":"1KI","chapter":17,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then the woman said to Elijah, “Now I know that you are a man of God and that the word of the LORD from your mouth is truth.”","from":24},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":14,"verseEnd":44,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From the Levites: Shemaiah son of Hasshub, the son of Azrikam, the son of Hashabiah, a descendant of Merari; Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal, and Mattaniah son of Mica, the son of Zichri, the son of Asaph; Obadiah son of Shemaiah, the son of Galal, the son of Jeduthun; and Berechiah son of Asa, the son of Elkanah, who lived in the villages of the Netophathites. These were the gatekeepers: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman, and their relatives. Shallum was their chief; he was previously stationed at the Kingʼs Gate on the east side. These were the gatekeepers from the camp of the Levites.","from":23},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":14,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From the Levites: Shemaiah son of Hasshub, the son of Azrikam, the son of Hashabiah, a descendant of Merari; Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal, and Mattaniah son of Mica, the son of Zichri, the son of Asaph; Obadiah son of Shemaiah, the son of Galal, the son of Jeduthun; and Berechiah son of Asa, the son of Elkanah, who lived in the villages of the Netophathites. These were the gatekeepers: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman, and their relatives. Shallum was their chief;","from":25},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":33,"verseEnd":34,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Those who were musicians, the heads of Levite families, stayed in the temple chambers and were exempt from other duties because they were on duty day and night. All these were heads of Levite families, chiefs according to their genealogies, and they lived in Jerusalem.","from":12},{"book":"1CH","chapter":15,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And he said to them, “You are the heads of the Levitical families. You and your relatives must consecrate yourselves so that you may bring the ark of the LORD, the God of Israel, to the place I have prepared for it.","from":12},{"book":"1CH","chapter":23,"verse":1,"verseEnd":32,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"When David was old and full of years, he installed his son Solomon as king over Israel. Then he gathered all the leaders of Israel, as well as the priests and Levites. The Levites thirty years of age or older were counted, and the total number of men was 38,000. “Of these,” said David, “24,000 are to oversee the work of the house of the LORD, 6,000 are to be officers and judges, 4,000 are to be gatekeepers, and 4,000 are to praise the LORD with the instruments I have made for giving praise.”","from":24}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"persian-era","title":"Persian era: Esther and the return","people":3}]},"27-30":{"people":[{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":27}],"places":[{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":3,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"netophah-h5199","name":"Netophah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"beth-azmaveth-h1041","name":"Beth-azmaveth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"geba-h1387g","name":"Geba","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"gilgal-h1537g","name":"Gilgal","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29}],"words":[{"base":"H1019","lemma":"בֵּית הַגִּלְגָּל","tr":"bet hag·gil·gal","gloss":"Beth-gilgal","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H3389","lemma":"יְרוּשָׁלִַ֫ם, יְרוּשְׁלֵם","tr":"ye·ru·sha·laim","gloss":"Jerusalem","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":643},{"base":"H2598","lemma":"חֲנֻכָּה","tr":"cha·nuk·kah","gloss":"dedication","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":8},{"base":"H7891","lemma":"שִׁיר","tr":"shir","gloss":"to sing","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":87},{"base":"H2891","lemma":"טָהֵר","tr":"ta·her","gloss":"be pure","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":94},{"base":"H2346","lemma":"חוֹמָה","tr":"cho·mah","gloss":"wall","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":133},{"base":"H2691","lemma":"חָצֵר","tr":"cha·tser","gloss":"court","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":191},{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":291},{"base":"H5439","lemma":"סָבִיב","tr":"sa·viv","gloss":"around","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":335},{"base":"H5820","lemma":"עַזְמָ֫וֶת","tr":"az·ma·vet","gloss":"Azmaveth","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":8}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1CH","chapter":15,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"David also told the leaders of the Levites to appoint their relatives as singers to lift up their voices with joy, accompanied by musical instruments—harps, lyres, and cymbals.","from":27},{"book":"GEN","chapter":35,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Jacob told his household and all who were with him, “Get rid of the foreign gods that are among you. Purify yourselves and change your garments.","from":30},{"book":"EXO","chapter":19,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then the LORD said to Moses, “Go to the people and consecrate them today and tomorrow. They must wash their clothes","from":30},{"book":"EXO","chapter":19,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“Be prepared for the third day,” he said to the people. “Do not draw near to a woman.”","from":30},{"book":"NUM","chapter":19,"verse":2,"verseEnd":20,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“This is the statute of the law that the LORD has commanded: Instruct the Israelites to bring you an unblemished red heifer that has no defect and has never been placed under a yoke. Give it to Eleazar the priest, and he will have it brought outside the camp and slaughtered in his presence. Eleazar the priest is to take some of its blood on his finger and splatter it seven times toward the front of the Tent of Meeting. Then the heifer must be burned in his sight. Its hide, its flesh, and its blood are to be burned, along with its dung. The priest is to take cedar wood, hyssop, and scarlet wool and throw them onto the burning heifer.","from":30},{"book":"DEU","chapter":11,"verse":30,"verseEnd":30,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Are not these mountains across the Jordan, west of the road toward the sunset, in the land of the Canaanites who live in the Arabah opposite Gilgal near the Oak of Moreh?","from":29},{"book":"DEU","chapter":16,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and you shall rejoice before the LORD your God in the place He will choose as a dwelling for His Name—you, your sons and daughters, your menservants and maidservants, and the Levite within your gates, as well as the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widows among you.","from":27},{"book":"DEU","chapter":20,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Furthermore, the officers are to address the army, saying, “Has any man built a new house and not dedicated it? Let him return home, or he may die in battle and another man dedicate it.","from":27}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"31-43":{"people":[{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"hoshaiah-h1955g","name":"Hoshaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"azariah-h5838x","name":"Azariah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"ezra-h5830h","name":"Ezra","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"meshullam-h4918u","name":"Meshullam","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"benjamin-h1144k","name":"Benjamin","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"jeremiah-h3414m","name":"Jeremiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"judah-h3063j","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"shemaiah-h8098t","name":"Shemaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"asaph-h0623g","name":"Asaph","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"jonathan-h3129k","name":"Jonathan","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"mattaniah-h4983o","name":"Mattaniah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"mica-h4316i","name":"Mica","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"shemaiah-h8098u","name":"Shemaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"zaccur-h2139j","name":"Zaccur","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"zechariah-h2148z-2","name":"Zechariah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":2,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"azarel-h5832j","name":"Azarel","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"ezra-h5830g","name":"Ezra","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"gilalai-h1562","name":"Gilalai","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"hanani-h2607k","name":"Hanani","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"judah-h3063k","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"maai-h4597","name":"Maai","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"milalai-h4450","name":"Milalai","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"nethanel-h5417p","name":"Nethanel","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"shemaiah-h8098v","name":"Shemaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"eliakim-h0471h","name":"Eliakim","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":41},{"id":"elioenai-h0454l","name":"Elioenai","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":41},{"id":"hananiah-h2608k","name":"Hananiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":41},{"id":"maaseiah-h4641v","name":"Maaseiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":41},{"id":"micaiah-h4320h","name":"Micaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":41},{"id":"miniamin-h4509h","name":"Miniamin","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":41},{"id":"zechariah-h2148y-2","name":"Zechariah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":41},{"id":"elam-h5867j","name":"Elam","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":42},{"id":"eleazar-h0499m","name":"Eleazar","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":42},{"id":"ezer-h5827","name":"Ezer","kind":"person","brief":"Returned builder","count":1,"firstVerse":42},{"id":"jehohanan-h3076q","name":"Jehohanan","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":42},{"id":"jezrahiah-h3156h","name":"Jezrahiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":42},{"id":"maaseiah-h4641w","name":"Maaseiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":42},{"id":"malchijah-h4441r","name":"Malchijah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":42},{"id":"shemaiah-h8098w","name":"Shemaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":42},{"id":"uzzi-h5813m","name":"Uzzi","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":42}],"places":[{"id":"dung-gate-h0830g","name":"Dung Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"fountain-gate-h5869b","name":"Fountain Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":37},{"id":"water-gate-h4325h","name":"Water Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":37},{"id":"broad-wall-h7342g","name":"Broad Wall","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":38},{"id":"tower-of-the-ovens-h4026i","name":"Tower of the Ovens","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":38},{"id":"ephraim-gate-h0669i","name":"Ephraim Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39},{"id":"fish-gate-h1709g","name":"Fish Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39},{"id":"guard-gate-h4307g","name":"Guard Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39},{"id":"sheep-gate-h6629h","name":"Sheep Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39},{"id":"tower-of-hananel-h2606","name":"Tower of Hananel","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39},{"id":"tower-of-the-hundred-h4026h","name":"Tower of the Hundred","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39},{"id":"yeshanah-gate-h3465g","name":"Yeshanah Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39},{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":43}],"words":[{"base":"H8179","lemma":"שַׁ֫עַר","tr":"sha·ar","gloss":"gate","lang":"h","inPassage":8,"uses":374},{"base":"H2346","lemma":"חוֹמָה","tr":"cho·mah","gloss":"wall","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":133},{"base":"H8098","lemma":"שְׁמַעְיָ֫הוּ","tr":"she·ma·yah","gloss":"Shemaiah","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":41},{"base":"H8426","lemma":"תּוֹדָה","tr":"to·dah","gloss":"thanksgiving","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":32},{"base":"H4026","lemma":"מִגְדָּל","tr":"mig·dal","gloss":"(Hananel) Tower","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":48},{"base":"H4320","lemma":"מִיכָיָה","tr":"mi·kha·yah","gloss":"Micaiah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":3},{"base":"H2677","lemma":"חֲצִי","tr":"che·tsi","gloss":"half","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":125},{"base":"H8055","lemma":"שָׂמַח","tr":"sa·mach","gloss":"to rejoice","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":155},{"base":"H3063","lemma":"יְהוּדָה","tr":"ye·hu·dah","gloss":"Judah","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":820},{"base":"H5830","lemma":"עֶזְרָא","tr":"ez·ra","gloss":"Ezra","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":22}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NEH","chapter":3,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"At the Sheep Gate, Eliashib the high priest and his fellow priests began rebuilding. They dedicated it and installed its doors. After building as far as the Tower of the Hundred and the Tower of Hananel, they dedicated the wall.","from":39},{"book":"EZR","chapter":3,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"The people could not distinguish the shouts of joy from the sound of weeping, because the people were making so much noise. And the sound was heard from afar.","from":43},{"book":"NEH","chapter":2,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"So I went out at night through the Valley Gate toward the Well of the Serpent and the Dung Gate, and I inspected the walls of Jerusalem that had been broken down and the gates that had been destroyed by fire.","from":31},{"book":"NEH","chapter":3,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Next to them, Uzziel son of Harhaiah, one of the goldsmiths, made repairs. And next to him, Hananiah, one of the perfumers, made repairs. They fortified Jerusalem as far as the Broad Wall.","from":38},{"book":"NEH","chapter":2,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Then I went on to the Fountain Gate and the Kingʼs Pool, but there was no room for the animal under me to get through;","from":37},{"book":"NEH","chapter":3,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"The Fish Gate was rebuilt by the sons of Hassenaah. They laid its beams and installed its doors, bolts, and bars.","from":39},{"book":"NEH","chapter":3,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"The Jeshanah Gate was repaired by Joiada son of Paseah and Meshullam son of Besodeiah. They laid its beams and installed its doors, bolts, and bars.","from":39},{"book":"NEH","chapter":3,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Malchijah son of Harim and Hasshub son of Pahath-moab repaired another section, as well as the Tower of the Ovens.","from":38}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":2}]},"44-47":{"people":[{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":44},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":44},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":2,"firstVerse":45},{"id":"solomon-h8010","name":"Solomon","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":45},{"id":"asaph-h0623g","name":"Asaph","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":46},{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":47},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":47},{"id":"nehemiah-h5166h","name":"Nehemiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":47},{"id":"zerubbabel-h2216","name":"Zerubbabel","kind":"person","brief":"Governor","count":1,"firstVerse":47}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":291},{"base":"H7891","lemma":"שִׁיר","tr":"shir","gloss":"to sing","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":87},{"base":"H4521","lemma":"מְנָת","tr":"me·nat","gloss":"portion","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":8},{"base":"H7778","lemma":"שֹׁעֵר","tr":"sho·er","gloss":"gatekeeper","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":37},{"base":"H4931","lemma":"מִשְׁמֶ֫רֶת","tr":"mish·me·ret","gloss":"charge","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":78},{"base":"H6942","lemma":"קָדַשׁ","tr":"qa·dash","gloss":"to consecrate: consecate","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":171},{"base":"H5393","lemma":"נִשְׁכָּה","tr":"nish·kah","gloss":"chamber","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"H5166","lemma":"נְחֶמְיָה","tr":"ne·chem·yah","gloss":"Nehemiah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"H3548","lemma":"כֹּהֵן","tr":"ko·hen","gloss":"priest","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":750},{"base":"H2893","lemma":"טׇהֳרָה","tr":"to·ho·rah","gloss":"purifying","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":11}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NEH","chapter":13,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"and all Judah brought a tenth of the grain, new wine, and oil into the storerooms.","from":44},{"book":"NEH","chapter":13,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"I appointed as treasurers over the storerooms Shelemiah the priest, Zadok the scribe, and Pedaiah of the Levites, with Hanan son of Zaccur, the son of Mattaniah, to assist them, because they were considered trustworthy. They were responsible for distributing the supplies to their fellow Levites.","from":44},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So you shall appoint Aaron and his sons to carry out the duties of the priesthood; but any outsider who approaches the tabernacle must be put to death.”","from":44},{"book":"NUM","chapter":8,"verse":24,"verseEnd":25,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“This applies to the Levites: Men twenty-five years of age or older shall enter to perform the service in the work at the Tent of Meeting. But at the age of fifty, they must retire from performing the work and no longer serve.","from":44},{"book":"NUM","chapter":18,"verse":21,"verseEnd":29,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Behold, I have given to the Levites all the tithes in Israel as an inheritance in return for the work they do, the service of the Tent of Meeting. No longer may the Israelites come near to the Tent of Meeting, or they will incur guilt and die. The Levites are to perform the work of the Tent of Meeting, and they must bear their iniquity. This is a permanent statute for the generations to come. The Levites will not receive an inheritance among the Israelites. For I have given to the Levites as their inheritance the tithe that the Israelites present to the LORD as a contribution. That is why I told them that they would not receive an inheritance among the Israelites.” And the LORD instructed Moses,","from":47},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But the four chief gatekeepers, who were Levites, were entrusted with the rooms and the treasuries of the house of God.","from":44},{"book":"1CH","chapter":23,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"but their duty was to assist the descendants of Aaron with the service of the house of the LORD, being responsible for the courts and chambers, the purification of all the holy things, and the work of the service of the house of God,","from":44},{"book":"1CH","chapter":23,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"but their duty was to assist the descendants of Aaron with the service of the house of the LORD, being responsible for the courts and chambers, the purification of all the holy things, and the work of the service of the house of God,","from":45}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":4},{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":3},{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":2},{"id":"persian-era","title":"Persian era: Esther and the return","people":2}]}}